bic-root\">مَحْفُوظٍ</span>","hinglish":"Balke woh buland-shaan Qur'an hai, Lauh-e-Mahfooz (hifazat ki gayi takhti) mein","translations":{"en":"Known / Determined","ur":"معلوم کیا ہوا (مقرر)","hi":"मालूम किया हुआ (मुक़र्रर)"},"ref":"85:21-22"},{"id":"s4l18_s1_s2","sentence_number":2,"arabic":"وَالطُّورِ وَكِتَابٍ مَسْطُورٍ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">وَ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">الطُّورِ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">وَ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">كِتَابٍ مَسْطُورٍ</span>","hinglish":"Qasam hai Toor ki, aur likhi hui Kitaab ki","translations":{"en":"Inscribed / Written","ur":"لکھا ہوا","hi":"लिखा हुआ"},"ref":"52:1-2"},{"id":"s4l18_s1_s3","sentence_number":3,"arabic":"ذَٰلِكَ يَوْمٌ مَجْمُوعٌ لَهُ النَّاسُ وَذَٰلِكَ يَوْمٌ مَشْهُودٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">ذَٰلِكَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">يَوْمٌ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">مَجْمُوعٌ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">لَهُ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">النَّاسُ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">وَذَٰلِكَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">يَوْمٌ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">مَشْهُودٌ</span>","hinglish":"Woh aisa din hai jiske liye sab log jama kiye jayenge aur woh haazri ka din hai","translations":{"ur":"وہ ایسا دن ہے جس کے لیے سب لوگ جمع کیے جائیں گے اور وہ حاضری کا دن ہے","en":"That is a Day for which the people will be collected, and that is a Day that will be witnessed","hi":"वह ऐसा दिन है जिसके लिए सब लोग जमा किए जाएँगे और वह हाज़िरी का दिन है"},"ref":"11:103"},{"id":"s4l18_s1_s4","sentence_number":4,"arabic":"إِنَّهُ كَانَ مَنْصُورًا","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّهُ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">كَانَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">مَنْصُورًا</span>","hinglish":"Beshak uski madad ki gayi","translations":{"ur":"بیشک اس کی مدد کی گئی","en":"Indeed, he has been assisted","hi":"बेशक उसकी मदद की गई"},"ref":"17:33"},{"id":"s4l18_s1_s5","sentence_number":5,"arabic":"إِنَّ هَٰذَا كَانَ لَكُمْ جَزَاءً وَكَانَ سَعْيُكُمْ مَشْكُورًا","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">هَٰذَا</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">كَانَ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">لَكُمْ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">جَزَاءً</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">وَكَانَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">سَعْي</span><span class=\"nonroot\">ُكُمْ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">مَشْكُورًا</span>","hinglish":"Beshak yeh tumhare liye badla hai aur tumhari koshish ki qadr (shukr) ki gayi","translations":{"ur":"بیشک یہ تمہارے لیے بدلہ ہے اور تمہاری کوشش کی قدر (شکر) کی گئی","en":"Indeed, this is for you a reward, and your effort has been appreciated","hi":"बेशक यह तुम्हारे लिए बदला है और तुम्हारी कोशिश की क़द्र (शुक्र) की गई"},"ref":"76:22"},{"id":"s4l18_s1_s6","sentence_number":6,"arabic":"وَكَانَ أَمْرُ اللَّهِ مَفْعُولًا","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">وَكَانَ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">أَمْرُ اللَّهِ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">مَفْعُولًا</span>","hinglish":"Aur Allah ka hukm hokar rehne wala (kiya gaya) hai","translations":{"en":"And the command of Allah is destined to be executed.","ur":"اور اللہ کا حکم تو پورا ہو کر ہی رہنے والا تھا۔","hi":"और अल्लाह का हुक्म तो पूरा होकर ही रहने वाला था।"},"ref":"4:47"},{"id":"s4l18_s1_s7","sentence_number":7,"arabic":"قَوْلٌ مَعْرُوفٌ وَمَغْفِرَةٌ خَيْرٌ مِنْ صَدَقَةٍ يَتْبَعُهَا أَذًى","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">قَوْلٌ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">مَعْرُوفٌ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">وَمَغْفِرَةٌ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">خَيْرٌ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">مِنْ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">صَدَقَةٍ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">يَتْبَعُهَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">أَذًى</span>","hinglish":"Achhi (ma'roof) baat kehna aur dar-guzar karna us sadaqe se behtar hai jiske peeche takleef dena ho","translations":{"ur":"اچھی (معروف) بات کہنا اور درگزر کرنا اس صدقے سے بہتر ہے جس کے پیچھے تکلیف دینا ہو","en":"Kind speech and forgiveness are better than charity followed by injury","hi":"अच्छी (मारूफ़) बात कहना और दरगुज़र करना उस सदक़े से बेहतर है जिसके पीछे तकलीफ़ देना हो"},"ref":"2:263"},{"id":"s4l18_s1_s8","sentence_number":8,"arabic":"إِنَّ السَّمْعَ وَالْبَصَرَ وَالْفُؤَادَ كُلُّ أُولَٰئِكَ كَانَ عَنْهُ مَسْئُولًا","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">السَّمْعَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">وَالْبَصَرَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">وَالْفُؤَادَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">كُلُّ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">أُولَٰئِكَ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">كَانَ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">عَنْهُ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">مَسْئُولًا</span>","hinglish":"Beshak kaan aur aankh aur dil — in sab ke baare mein poochh-gachh ki jayegi","translations":{"ur":"بیشک کان اور آنکھ اور دل — ان سب کے بارے میں پوچھ گچھ کی جائے گی","en":"Indeed, the hearing, the sight and the heart — about all those one will be questioned","hi":"बेशक कान और आँख और दिल — इन सबके बारे में पूछताछ की जाएगी"},"ref":"17:36"}]}}]}}